  "wn39MapKinds": "The map is a choice of kinds again: the flat map as it always was (the default), the 3D globe, the satellite's earth, and a modern flat 2D.",
  "wn39EyeIp": "The location card carries an eye: tap it to see the address the traffic leaves from, and copy it.",
  "wn39Profile": "Accounts carry their own name and profile picture, and the app can open behind a password.",
  "wn39Smart": "The smart connection grew: the fastest location by real latency, and QUIC pass-through for calls and games.",
  "wn39Flight": "A change of country flies smoother — the camera rides the great circle — and the flag wheel's markers sit closer to the flags.",
  "wn39ToastEverywhere": "The dynamic note is everywhere now: every saved, copied, and failed notice wears the same animated glass pill.",
  "wn39Updates": "Updates keep the storage clean: the installer replaces the old version, and no package is left behind.",
